{"type":"standard","title":"Zach Nunn","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Zach Nunn</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q84719792","titles":{"canonical":"Zach_Nunn","normalized":"Zach Nunn","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Zach Nunn</span></span>"},"pageid":67576919,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7a/Official_Portrait_of_Rep._Zach_Lunn_119th_Congress.jpg/330px-Official_Portrait_of_Rep._Zach_Lunn_119th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7a/Official_Portrait_of_Rep._Zach_Lunn_119th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":640,"height":800},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1377486483","tid":"304901e2-bc28-11f1-9fe6-6d61ec01dc07","timestamp":"2026-09-29T17:07:02Z","description":"American politician (born 1979)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zach_Nunn","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zach_Nunn?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zach_Nunn?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Zach_Nunn"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zach_Nunn","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Zach_Nunn","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zach_Nunn?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Zach_Nunn"}},"extract":"Zachary Martin Nunn is an American politician and United States Air Force officer who has served as the U.S. representative for Iowa's 3rd congressional district since 2023. A member of the Republican Party, he was a member of the Iowa Senate for the 15th district from 2019 to 2023 and the Iowa House of Representatives for the 30th district from 2015 to 2019.","extract_html":"<p><b>Zachary Martin Nunn</b> is an American politician and United States Air Force officer who has served as the U.S. representative for Iowa's 3rd congressional district since 2023. A member of the Republican Party, he was a member of the Iowa Senate for the 15th district from 2019 to 2023 and the Iowa House of Representatives for the 30th district from 2015 to 2019.</p>"}